  "notes": {
    "zh": [
      "战场阵容管理与处决修复",
      "新增内容",
      "红蓝卡片顶部新增「管理阵容」，点名单摘要的「+N」也能打开。按场上实例显示同名单位编号、生命和状态。备战或战后可移除选中的一只，它带出的配合单位也会一并回收。战斗中仍可查看名单。",
      "「观战」新增独立的红光和蓝光预警开关。开启后，红蓝对打或随从打地图敌人时可补播招式原有的对应闪光。开关默认关闭，设置自动保存。",
      "「观战」的处决镜头下方新增「旧版处决外观」。默认关闭，保持 Boss 自身外观。打开后，部分红蓝处决沿用旧版借模方式，安装魂的外观替换时，借来的模型有时会露出来。悬停可查看适用范围。",
      "对战调整",
      "烈焰上桩后，仍锁着烈焰的招式和飞剑会转向同一波可交战的小狮子。确认最后一只达到原版 20% 保留血线后，可在满足条件时接原版狮头处决。拿到狮头后沿用上桩和对射流程。对应 #48。",
      "七星剑阵整队确认阵亡后，胜方清理仍指向阵亡成员的仇恨和锁定。脱战回血按原设置生效，尸体沿用原有回收时机。",
      "问题修复",
      "红蓝处决默认先核对借用模型已经隐藏，再用于播放动作。结束后核对临时组件已回收，并恢复原来的动画设置。临时骨架提前被销毁时也会核对原设定。",
      "修复召唤 NPC 的原版强制慢走动作可能把「只能移动」写进本机玩家输入的问题。从备战到清场，检查动作归属，防止退出观战后技能和互动失灵。",
      "GitHub 接口暂不可用时，助手会用 GitHub 正式发布页确认最新版本。检查失败时直接显示本机安装的版本。"
    ],
    "en": [
      "Battlefield lineup management and execution fixes",
      "What's new",
      "Open Manage lineup or +N on either team card to see individual units, including numbered copies of the same character, health, and status. Before or after a fight, remove one selected unit along with its own summoned helpers. The lineup can also be viewed during combat.",
      "Spectate now has separate switches for red and blue attack flashes. Enable them to restore the original warning flashes in arena and companion fights. Both are off by default and your choices are saved.",
      "Legacy execution appearance is available below Execution camera and is off by default. Turn it on to use the old pose setup for some Red vs Blue executions. With a Hun outfit replacement installed, the borrowed model can sometimes show through. Hover for details.",
      "Combat adjustments",
      "Attacks and flying swords that still target Flame on a pole switch to available cubs in her own wave. When the last cub reaches its native 20% floor and the other requirements are met, its original lion head execution can proceed. The head is used for the existing pole duel. Addresses #48.",
      "Once the entire Seven-Star Sword Formation is confirmed defeated, the winners clear lingering hostility and locks on its fallen fighters. Out-of-combat healing follows your settings and bodies use the existing cleanup rules.",
      "Fixes",
      "Red vs Blue executions now verify that the borrowed pose model is hidden before use and confirm its removal afterwards. Original animation settings are restored even when the temporary pose component is destroyed early.",
      "Fixed an NPC walk-only action that could restrict the local player's input. Ownership is checked from preparation through cleanup so skills and interactions continue to work after leaving spectator mode.",
      "If the GitHub API is temporarily unavailable, the assistant checks the official GitHub release page. An unsuccessful check shows the version installed on this PC."
    ]
  },
